   "text": "**M6_regional_fwr_cdr_biophysics** · hypothesis\n\nRegional antibody biophysics (FWR1-4 core stability + Ewert 2003 V-family stability + Raybould 2019 TAP CDR charge/hydrophobicity + SFvCSP VH*VL charge symmetry + CamSol solubility) achieves positive Spearman on large datasets (Wittrup2017 n=137, n>=10 mean, and N-weighted mean) as well as beating score/ by >=0.05 on unweighted category means",
